1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:05,140
We're going to start this list with my personal favorite thing to do in York and that is to walk the city walls.
先从我个人在约克最喜欢的活动说起：沿着古城墙走一走。

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:11,430
York walls are the most complete example of medieval city walls that you will find still standing in England today.
约克城墙是今天英格兰仍然矗立、保存最完整的一类中世纪城墙。

3
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:15,100
The walk is over two and a half miles long although this does include a few breaks.
全程步行超过两英里半，不过中间有几处断开的地方。

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:22,169
These breaks do mean that you can easily enter and exit the walls at different points so you don't have to do the full walk if you don't want to.
这些缺口让你可以在不同地点上下城墙，所以不想走完全程也没关系。

5
00:00:22,179 --> 00:00:26,679
As you walk the walls you will get a great perspective over the city buildings and beautiful gardens.
走在城墙上，可以从很棒的角度看到城市建筑和美丽的花园。

6
00:00:26,679 --> 00:00:31,410
Spot interesting brass markers on the floor and pass by gate houses known as bars.
还会看到地上有意思的黄铜标记，并经过一些被称作 bars 的城门楼。

7
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,230
Which are tall towers which acted to defend the city.
这些高塔过去承担着保卫城市的作用。

8
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:40,179
Not only are these walls a great way to spend an hour or two getting a feel for the city but walking the city walls is free.
沿着城墙走上一两个小时，不仅能感受这座城市，而且按原片所述，步行城墙本身还是免费的。

9
00:00:40,179 --> 00:00:45,629
There are a couple of small museums along the wall on Henry vii and Richard iii that you can visit for a fee.
城墙沿线有两家分别介绍亨利七世和理查三世的小博物馆，可以付费参观。

10
00:00:45,639 --> 00:00:50,129
But to just pop up and go for a stroll above the streets there is no charge.
不过只是上城墙、在街道上方散散步，就不收费。

11
00:00:50,139 --> 00:00:58,590
Not only does York have the best preserved medieval city walls in the country but it also has arguably the best preserved medieval street in the country too.
约克不但有国内保存很好的中世纪城墙，也可以说有国内保存最好的中世纪街道之一。

12
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:02,430
The Shambles is a narrow cobbled street lined with old crooked leaning buildings.
Shambles 肉铺街是一条狭窄的石板街，两旁是古老、歪斜、彼此倾靠的建筑。

13
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:12,100
It is sometimes said that there is a point where the top floors lean so close together that supposedly you could actually shake hands through the window with the person across the streets from you.
有人说，某处楼上两边靠得那么近，你甚至可以隔着窗户，和街对面的人握手。

14
00:01:12,339 --> 00:01:18,150
The streets used to be home to several butcher shops and you can still spot the meat hooks attached to the shop fronts.
这条街过去有很多肉铺，店面上还可以看到挂肉钩。

15
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:24,580
The pavements were raised so that the sloped cobbled streets formed a channel for butchers to be able to dump the blood and waste from their shop to be washed away.
两侧人行道抬高，倾斜的石路形成一条沟渠，方便肉铺把血水和废料倒进去冲走。

16
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:31,500
Fortunately the street is much more sanitary today and is now filled with shops and places to grab something to eat.
幸运的是，今天的街道卫生多了，已经满是商店和可以找点吃的地方。

17
00:01:33,339 --> 00:01:35,860
York is a great place to indulge your sweet tooth.
约克也是满足甜食爱好的好地方。

18
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:41,310
You can start right here on the Shambles with a visit to york's longest established artisan chocolatiers.
从肉铺街就可以开始，去看看约克历史悠久的手工巧克力店。

19
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:45,339
Monk bar chocolatiers create over 50 types of luxury handmade chocolates.
Monk Bar Chocolatiers 制作五十多种精致手工巧克力。

20
00:01:45,339 --> 00:01:51,030
We tried a melted chocolate shots which came in a dark chocolate glass and yes it was as good as it sounds.
我们试了一小杯融化巧克力，连杯子都是黑巧克力做的。没错，吃起来和听起来一样棒。

21
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:53,800
If fudge is more your thing then try visiting the fudge kitchen.
如果你更喜欢软糖，可以试试 Fudge Kitchen。

22
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:57,220
Their creamy fudge is so nice and comes in lots of different flavors.
他们的奶油软糖很好吃，口味也很多。

23
00:01:57,220 --> 00:02:03,150
And if you time your trip just right you might even get to see them making some of the fudge right there in the store.
如果到得正好，甚至可以看到他们在店里现场制作软糖。

24
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:10,230
If you want to learn more about the history of chocolate making in York then you can take a guided tour over at york's chocolate story.
如果想进一步了解约克巧克力制作的历史，还可以去 York’s Chocolate Story 参加导览。

25
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:16,120
For something savory there are plenty of options to grab a quick bite to eat but we'll give you a few ideas to get you started.
想吃咸口的话，也有很多可以买点快餐的地方。这里先给你几个参考。

26
00:02:16,899 --> 00:02:20,619
Jumbo's kitchen is an ideal stop for anyone who likes slow cooked meat.
喜欢慢炖肉的话，Jumbo’s Kitchen 是个合适的停靠点。

27
00:02:20,619 --> 00:02:24,280
Their popular pulled pork sandwiches are absolutely delicious.
他们很受欢迎的手撕猪肉三明治特别好吃。

28
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:27,820
Another excellent option for sandwiches is the York roast company.
三明治的另一个好选择是 York Roast Company。

29
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:30,479
Where you can grab yourself a roast dinner inspired sandwich.
在那里可以吃到以英式烤肉正餐为灵感的三明治。

30
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:37,059
You can even get to your meat roast vegetables stuffing and gravy served up inside a Yorkshire pudding wrap.
甚至可以把肉、烤蔬菜、填料和肉汁一并包进约克郡布丁卷里。

31
00:02:37,059 --> 00:02:41,680
For some more varied options head to Shambles food court over at Shambles markets for some street food.
想要更多不同选择，可以去 Shambles 市场的美食区找街头小吃。

32
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:47,189
Pizza crepes hot dogs Thai dishes burritos and more you're bound to see something that you like the look of.
披萨、可丽饼、热狗、泰餐、墨西哥卷饼等等，总有一种看着让你喜欢。

33
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:51,210
And when you're finished you can take a look around the market stalls.
吃完以后，还可以逛逛市场摊位。

34
00:02:51,220 --> 00:02:56,969
Next on our list is a must do for your trip and that is to visit the iconic York Minster.
清单下一项是来这里很值得做的一件事：参观标志性的约克大教堂。

35
00:02:56,979 --> 00:03:00,940
This incredible building is one of the largest cathedrals in northern Europe.
这座令人惊叹的建筑，是北欧最大的主教座堂之一。

36
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:04,839
It took around 250 years to build and really is a sight to behold.
它大约花了二百五十年建成，确实是一处令人赞叹的景象。
